<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>HealthOrbit — Health Timeline</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/sidebar.css">
<style>
:root {
  --void: #084039; --void-soft: #0d7a6e;
  --paper: #f2f8f6; --card: #ffffff;
  --ink: #0f1c1a; --ink-soft: #5e736f;
  --coral: #ef6f5b; --coral-soft: #fbe4de;
  --sage: #109485; --sage-soft: #dff1ec;
  --mist: #42b89d; --line: rgba(13, 122, 110, 0.15); 
  --radius: 24px;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); overflow-x: hidden; }
.mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }

/* Ambient Orbs */
.ambient { position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; }
.orb { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(90px); opacity: 0.35; animation: float 22s infinite alternate; }
.orb1 { width: 420px; height: 420px; background: #a3e4d7; top: -120px; left: -100px; }
.orb2 { width: 460px; height: 460px; background: #fcefc9; bottom: -140px; right: -100px; animation-delay: -6s; }
@keyframes float { 100% { transform: translate(40px, 40px) scale(1.1); } }

/* Layout */
.shell { display: flex; width: 100vw; min-height: 100vh; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.main { flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100vh; overflow-y: auto;}

/* Topbar */
.topbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; padding: 2.5rem 3.5rem 1.5rem; background: transparent; z-index: 10; position: sticky; top: 0; backdrop-filter: blur(20px);}
.topbar h1 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.8rem; color: var(--void);}
.topbar .sub { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 0.4rem; font-weight: 500;}

/* Filters */
.filter-group { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); padding: 6px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line);}
.filter-btn { border: none; background: transparent; padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--ink-soft); cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s;}
.filter-btn.active { background: #fff; color: var(--void); box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(8,64,57,0.05);}
.filter-btn:hover:not(.active) { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }

/* Workspace */
.workspace { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; padding: 1rem 3.5rem 4rem; }

/* ---------- LEFT: THE TIMELINE ---------- */
.timeline-container { position: relative; padding-left: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem;}
.timeline-container::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 6px; top: 10px; bottom: 0; width: 2px; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--mist), rgba(66, 184, 157, 0.1)); }

.tl-event { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; animation: slideIn 0.5s ease-out forwards; opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);}
@keyframes slideIn { to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); } }
.tl-event:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
.tl-event:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
.tl-event:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }

.tl-marker { position: absolute; left: -2.35rem; top: 0; width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--card); border: 3px solid var(--void); box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.6); z-index: 2;}
.tl-marker.report { border-color: var(--sage); }
.tl-marker.med { border-color: var(--coral); }
.tl-marker.wearable { border-color: var(--mist); }

.tl-date { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-soft); }

.tl-card { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); backdrop-filter: blur(25px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,1); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(8, 64, 57, 0.04); transition: 0.3s; cursor: pointer;}
.tl-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 12px 25px rgba(8, 64, 57, 0.08); border-color: var(--sage-soft);}

.tl-card-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;}
.tl-icon { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.2rem; flex-shrink: 0;}
.tl-icon.report { background: var(--sage-soft); color: var(--sage); }
.tl-icon.med { background: var(--coral-soft); color: var(--coral); }
.tl-icon.wearable { background: rgba(223, 241, 236, 0.8); color: var(--mist); }

.tl-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--void); display: block;}
.tl-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.5;}

.tl-metrics { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;}
.tl-pill { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; color: var(--void-soft);}

/* ---------- RIGHT: HEALTH JOURNEY REPLAY ---------- */
.replay-panel { position: sticky; top: 120px; height: calc(100vh - 160px); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--void), var(--void-soft)); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 2.5rem; color: #fff; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(8, 64, 57, 0.15); overflow: hidden;}
.replay-panel::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: -50%; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(115deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), transparent); transform: skewX(-20deg); animation: shine 6s infinite; }
@keyframes shine { 0% { left: -100%; } 20% { left: 200%; } 100% { left: 200%; } }

.replay-header { margin-bottom: 2rem; position: relative; z-index: 2;}
.replay-header h2 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;}
.replay-header p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #dcebe8; line-height: 1.5;}

/* Media Player UI */
.player-ui { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 2rem; position: relative; z-index: 2;}
.month-display { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--mist);}

.scrubber-track { width: 100%; height: 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 999px; position: relative; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;}
.scrubber-fill { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; height: 100%; width: 65%; background: var(--mist); border-radius: 999px; }
.scrubber-handle { position: absolute; left: 65%; top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); width: 16px; height: 16px; background: #fff; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); transition: 0.1s;}

.controls { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center;}
.ctrl-btn { background: none; border: none; color: #fff; font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; opacity: 0.8;}
.ctrl-btn:hover { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.1);}
.play-btn { width: 44px; height: 44px; background: var(--coral); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; opacity: 1; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(239, 111, 91, 0.4);}

/* AI Replay Summary */
.replay-summary { flex: 1; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.5rem; position: relative; z-index: 2; overflow-y: auto;}
.replay-summary h4 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; margin-bottom: 1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;}
.replay-summary p { font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #dcebe8; margin-bottom: 1rem;}
.replay-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem;}
.r-stat { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15); padding: 0.8rem; border-radius: 10px;}
.r-stat span { display: block; font-size: 0.65rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: #a4c9c3; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.2rem;}
.r-stat strong { font-size: 1.1rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;}

@media (max-width: 1024px) { .workspace { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .replay-panel { position: relative; top: 0; height: auto; margin-bottom: 2rem;} }
@media (max-width: 768px) { .topbar { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 1.5rem; } .workspace { padding: 1.5rem; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="ambient"><div class="orb orb1"></div><div class="orb orb2"></div></div>

<div class="shell">
  <!-- Universal Sidebar Include -->
  <%- include('../partials/sidebar') %>

  <main class="main">
    <div class="topbar">
      <div>
        <h1>Health Timeline</h1>
        <div class="sub">A complete chronological history of your medical journey.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="filter-group">
        <button class="filter-btn active">All</button>
        <button class="filter-btn">Reports</button>
        <button class="filter-btn">Wearables</button>
        <button class="filter-btn">Medicines</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="workspace">
      
      <!-- LEFT PANE: VERTICAL TIMELINE -->
      <div class="timeline-container">
        
        <div class="tl-event">
          <div class="tl-marker report"></div>
          <span class="tl-date">TODAY, 10:42 AM</span>
          <div class="tl-card">
            <div class="tl-card-header">
              <div class="tl-icon report">📄</div>
              <div>
                <span class="tl-title">Complete Blood Count Uploaded</span>
                <span class="tl-desc">OCR Engine extracted 4 parameters successfully.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tl-metrics">
              <span class="tl-pill">Hemoglobin: 13.2 g/dL</span>
              <span class="tl-pill">WBC: 7,200 /µL</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-event">
          <div class="tl-marker med"></div>
          <span class="tl-date">AUG 18, 2026</span>
          <div class="tl-card">
            <div class="tl-card-header">
              <div class="tl-icon med">💊</div>
              <div>
                <span class="tl-title">Started Medication: Vitamin D3</span>
                <span class="tl-desc">Protocol added: 60K IU, once weekly after breakfast.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-event">
          <div class="tl-marker wearable"></div>
          <span class="tl-date">AUG 15, 2026</span>
          <div class="tl-card">
            <div class="tl-card-header">
              <div class="tl-icon wearable">⌚</div>
              <div>
                <span class="tl-title">Anomaly Detected: Elevated BPM</span>
                <span class="tl-desc">Resting heart rate increased to 82 BPM over a 3-day average.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tl-metrics">
              <span class="tl-pill">Source: Apple HealthKit</span>
              <span class="tl-pill" style="color: var(--coral);">Status: Review</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-event">
          <div class="tl-marker report"></div>
          <span class="tl-date">JUL 28, 2026</span>
          <div class="tl-card">
            <div class="tl-card-header">
              <div class="tl-icon report">📄</div>
              <div>
                <span class="tl-title">ECG Summary Uploaded</span>
                <span class="tl-desc">Normal sinus rhythm detected. No acute ST-T changes.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT PANE: HEALTH JOURNEY REPLAY -->
      <div>
        <div class="replay-panel">
          <div class="replay-header">
            <h2>Health Journey Replay</h2>
            <p>Scrub through your longitudinal timeline. Watch how your vitals, reports, and symptoms evolved over time.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="player-ui">
            <div class="month-display">AUGUST 2026</div>
            <div class="scrubber-track">
              <div class="scrubber-fill"></div>
              <div class="scrubber-handle"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="controls">
              <button class="ctrl-btn">⏮</button>
              <button class="ctrl-btn play-btn">▶</button>
              <button class="ctrl-btn">⏭</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="replay-summary">
            <h4>✨ AI Replay Summary</h4>
            <p>During August, your activity levels dropped slightly, correlating with the elevated resting BPM detected by your wearable on Aug 15. You uploaded a CBC report revealing Vitamin D deficiency, and successfully initiated a new supplement protocol.</p>
            
            <div class="replay-stats">
              <div class="r-stat">
                <span>Avg Resting BPM</span>
                <strong>78 <small style="font-size:0.7rem; font-family:sans-serif;">BPM</small></strong>
              </div>
              <div class="r-stat">
                <span>Reports Logged</span>
                <strong>2</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</div>

</body>
</html>